+issueNumber: MDL-89890
+notes:
+  mod_forum:
+    - message: >-
+        The view/manage subscribers selector in the `mod_forum/forum_subscription_action`
+        template is now rendered using `core/tertiary_navigation_selector` (a
+        `\core\output\select_menu`) instead of `core/url_select`. For backwards
+        compatibility, the `viewandmanageselect` context exported by
+        `\mod_forum\output\subscription_actionbar::export_for_template()` still
+        contains the `core/url_select` compatible data (`formid`, `id`, `classes`,
+        `sesskey`, `action`, ...) so that overridden or copied templates which still
+        use `{{>core/url_select}}` keep working. This compatibility data is
+        deprecated and will be removed in a future version; templates should be
+        updated to use `{{>core/tertiary_navigation_selector}}`.
+      type: deprecated
